{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udff0\u00a0<strong>A little fantasy of laughter and tears \u2014 a story for the grown-up heart.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An RPG on the brink of cancellation, riddled with bugs.<br>You become the hero, searching for the source of the glitches \u2014 the <i>\u201cBug Insects\u201d</i> \u2014 and collecting their core, the <i>\u201cBug Programs.\u201d</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Bug Programs you obtain won\u2019t just fix problems \u2014<br>they become the keys that open new paths elsewhere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress, a story that lingers gently in the heart begins to reveal itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique puzzle-solving adventure where you gather <i>Bug Programs</i> to carve new routes forward</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story for adults, where humor, nostalgia, and quiet melancholy intersect</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A layered world shaped by meta structures: fiction and reality, past and present, despair and hope</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nostalgic yet fresh visuals, combining pixel art with post-processing effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No time-consuming battles or grinding \u2014 enjoy the puzzles and story at a smooth, comfortable pace</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfa5 Streaming &amp; Let's Play Guidelines</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are <strong>free to stream, create Let's Play videos, and share screenshots</strong> of &quot;RETRYS&quot;!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Both commercial and non-commercial use are allowed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No need for credit or prior permission \u2014 but we\u2019d love to hear from you on X (@retrys_project)!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"\uff08\u958b\u767a\u4e2d\u306e\u5b9f\u7e3e1\uff09","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steams