yered world shaped by meta structures: fiction and reality, past and present, despair and hope</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nostalgic yet fresh visuals, combining pixel art with post-processing effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No time-consuming battles or grinding \u2014 enjoy the puzzles and story at a smooth, comfortable pace</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfa5 Streaming &amp; Let's Play Guidelines</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are <strong>free to stream, create Let's Play videos, and share screenshots</strong> of &quot;RETRYS&quot;!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Both commercial and non-commercial use are allowed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No need for credit or prior permission \u2014 but we\u2019d love to hear from you on X (@retrys_project)!</p>","developers":["Studio Garage Inc."],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830610/cd27289c475467a3ede5b83080e20e03276c1054/header.jpg?t=1768896385","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Studio Garage Inc.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3830610/311988514/375ed6542853b44694b82abb2ddf2f38a02a06e7/1755568506/dash_av1.mpd?t=1755569962","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3830610/311988514/375ed6542853b44694b82abb2ddf2f38a02a06e7/1755568506/dash_h264.mpd?t=1755569962","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3830610/3